@startuml Registration Sequence

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor LightYellow
    BorderColor Gray
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor LightGreen
    BorderColor DarkGreen
}

title NotDjinni - User Registration Sequence Diagram

actor "User" as User
participant "System" as System
database "Database" as DB

== Registration Request ==

User -> System: Submit email and password
activate System

== Verify Email Uniqueness ==

System -> DB: Check if email exists
activate DB
DB --> System: Email not found
deactivate DB

== Validate and Secure ==

System -> System: Validate email format
System -> System: Validate password strength
System -> System: Secure password

== Create User Account ==

System -> DB: Create user account
activate DB
DB --> System: Account created
deactivate DB

== Generate Authentication Tokens ==

System -> System: Generate authentication tokens

== Store Session ==

System -> DB: Store authentication session
activate DB
DB --> System: Session stored
deactivate DB

== Response ==

System --> User: Registration successful\nReceive authentication tokens
deactivate System

@enduml
